                    <div className="mb-6">
                      <div className="flex justify-center mb-6">
                        <div className="flex flex-col items-center">
                          <div className="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 mb-3 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <BitcoinLogoIcon className="h-8 w-8 text-orange-500" />
                          </div>
                          <div className="flex space-x-1 mb-2">
                            <div className="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                              <Layers className="h-4 w-4 text-orange-500" />
                            </div>
                            <div className="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                              <Shield className="h-4 w-4 text-orange-500" />
                            </div>
                            <div className="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                              <Hash className="h-4 w-4 text-orange-500" />
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div className="text-xs text-center text-muted-foreground">
                            Blockchain + PoW Consensus + Fixed Supply
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      
                      <p className="text-muted-foreground mb-4 text-sm">
                        The first and most successful application of blockchain technology. It's a peer-to-peer electronic cash system that enables value transfer without intermediaries, combining blockchain with proof-of-work consensus and a fixed monetary policy.
                      </p>
                      
                      <div className="space-y-2 mt-4">
                        <div className="flex items-center">
                          <Check className="h-4 w-4 text-orange-500 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" />
                          <span className="text-xs">Decentralized monetary network</span>
                        </div>
                        <div className="flex items-center">
                          <Check className="h-4 w-4 text-orange-500 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" />
                          <span className="text-xs">Energy-backed security model</span>
                        </div>
                        <div className="flex items-center">
                          <Check className="h-4 w-4 text-orange-500 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" />
                          <span className="text-xs">Fixed supply of 21 million</span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </motion.div>
                
                {/* Cryptocurrency */}
                <motion.div 
                  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}
                  whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
                  viewport={{ once: true }}
                  transition={{ duration: 0.5, delay: 0.3 }}
                  className="bg-card rounded-xl border shadow-md overflow-hidden"
                >
                  <div className="p-6 border-b bg-purple-500/5 flex justify-between items-center">
                    <h3 className="text-xl font-bold flex items-center">
                      <Rocket className="h-5 w-5 text-purple-500 mr-2" />
                      <span>Cryptocurrency</span>
                    </h3>
                    <Badge variant="outline" className="bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-500 border-purple-500/20">Category</Badge>
                  </div>
                  
                  <div className="p-6">
                    <div className="mb-6">
                      <div className="flex justify-center mb-6">
                        <div className="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 max-w-[180px]">
                          <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-orange-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <BitcoinLogoIcon className="h-5 w-5 text-orange-500" />
                          </div>
                          <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <Code className="h-5 w-5 text-blue-500" />
                          </div>
                          <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-green-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <Zap className="h-5 w-5 text-green-500" />
                          </div>
                          <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <Database className="h-5 w-5 text-purple-500" />
                          </div>
                          <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-pink-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <LucideEyeOff className="h-5 w-5 text-pink-500" />
                          </div>
                          <div className="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gray-500/20 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <span className="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500">...</span>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      
                      <p className="text-muted-foreground mb-4 text-sm">
                        The broader category of digital assets that use cryptography for security. After Bitcoin's success, thousands of alternative cryptocurrencies emerged with modified features—often compromising decentralization for additional functionality.
                      </p>
                      
                      <div className="space-y-2 mt-4">
                        <div className="flex items-center">
                          <Check className="h-4 w-4 text-purple-500 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" />
                          <span className="text-xs">Smart contracts (programmable)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div className="flex items-center">
                          <Check className="h-4 w-4 text-purple-500 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" />
                          <span className="text-xs">Various consensus mechanisms</span>
                        </div>
                        <div className="flex items-center">
                          <Check className="h-4 w-4 text-purple-500 mr-2 flex-shrink-0" />
                          <span className="text-xs">Different monetary policies</span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </motion.div>
              </div>
              
              <motion.div 
                initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}
                whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
                viewport={{ once: true }}
                transition={{ duration: 0.6 }}
                className="bg-card rounded-xl border shadow-md overflow-hidden"
              >
                <div className="p-6 border-b bg-amber-500/5">
                  <h3 className="text-xl font-bold flex items-center">
                    <Lightbulb className="h-5 w-5 text-amber-500 mr-2" />
                    <span>Key Insight</span>
                  </h3>
                </div>
                
                <div className="p-6">
                  <p className="text-muted-foreground mb-6">
                    Bitcoin was designed specifically as sound money with maximum security and censorship resistance, while most other cryptocurrencies prioritize different goals like programmability, transaction speed, or specific use cases.
                  </p>
                  
                  <div className="bg-muted/50 p-5 rounded-lg border border-amber-500/10">
                    <h4 className="font-medium mb-4">The Fundamental Trade-offs</h4>
                    <div className="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                      <div className="p-4 bg-background rounded-lg border">
                        <div className="flex items-center mb-3">
                          <Shield className="h-5 w-5 text-orange-500 mr-2" />
                          <h5 className="font-medium">Security</h5>
                        </div>
                        <p className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                          Bitcoin prioritizes security above all other considerations, using energy as its foundation.
                        </p>
                      </div>
                      
                      <div className="p-4 bg-background rounded-lg border">
                        <div className="flex items-center mb-3">
                          <Users className="h-5 w-5 text-orange-500 mr-2" />
                          <h5 className="font-medium">Decentralization</h5>
                        </div>
                        <p className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                          Bitcoin maintains the most decentralized validator set, ensuring no single entity can control the network.
                        </p>
                      </div>
                      
                      <div className="p-4 bg-background rounded-lg border">
                        <div className="flex items-center mb-3">
                          <Zap className="h-5 w-5 text-orange-500 mr-2" />
                          <h5 className="font-medium">Scalability</h5>
                        </div>
                        <p className="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
                          Bitcoin scales through layered solutions (like Lightning Network) rather than compromising the base layer.
                        </p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </motion.div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        
        {/* Call to Action Section */}
        <section className="py-24 bg-orange-500/5">
          <div className="container mx-auto px-4">
            <motion.div
              initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 20 }}
              whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
              transition={{ duration: 0.6 }}
              viewport={{ once: true }}
              className="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center"
            >
              <h2 className="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6">
                Understand Bitcoin's Fundamental Difference
              </h2>
              <p className="text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
                Bitcoin is not just another cryptocurrency—it's a fundamentally different monetary system designed from first principles to be secure, decentralized, and censorship-resistant.
              </p>
              
              <div className="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
                <Link to="/principles" className="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow hover:bg-primary/90 h-11 px-8">
                  <Shield className="mr-2 h-5 w-5" />
                  Explore Bitcoin Principles
                </Link>
                <Link to="/perspectives" className="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground shadow hover:bg-secondary/80 h-11 px-8">
                  <Compass className="mr-2 h-5 w-5" />
                  Discover More Perspectives
                </Link>
              </div>
              
              <div className="mt-16 p-8 bg-card border rounded-xl shadow-md">
                <h3 className="text-xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center justify-center">
                  <Quote className="h-5 w-5 text-orange-500 mr-2" />
                  <span>Final Thought</span>
                </h3>
                <blockquote className="text-lg italic text-muted-foreground">
                  "Bitcoin isn't just a better version of previous financial systems—it's an entirely new paradigm of money that eliminates the need for trusted third parties while providing an immutable, censorship-resistant store of value."
                </blockquote>
              </div>
            </motion.div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
      
      <Footer />
    </div>
  );
};

export default BitcoinVsCrypto; 